---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
import Schema from '../components/Schema.astro';
import { existsSync } from 'node:fs';
import { pricingFiberLaser, pricingCncRouter, pricingCo2Laser, pricingServices } from '../data/pricing';
import { formatPrice } from '../lib/utils';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const hasHeroImage = existsSync('public/img/harga-srifika-hero.webp');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Daftar Harga Jasa Laser Cutting Palembang Terbaru 2026"
  description="Daftar tarif resmi jasa laser cutting Palembang 2026 Sriwijaya Grafika. Tarif potong plat fiber laser, CNC router ACP/MDF, dan laser CO2 akrilik presisi."
  ogImage="/img/harga-srifika-hero.webp"
  schemaType="LocalBusiness"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Beranda', slug: '/' }, { name: 'Harga', slug: '/harga/' }]}
>
  <section class="relative pt-36 pb-20 border-b border-zinc-800 overflow-hidden">
    {hasHeroImage && (
      <div class="absolute inset-0">
        <img
          src="/img/harga-srifika-hero.webp"
          alt="Srifika menunjukkan daftar harga jasa laser cutting di workshop Laserindo Palembang"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-surface via-brand-surface/80 to-brand-surface/10"></div>
      </div>
    )}
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 border border-brand-primary/20 text-brand-primary text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
          Tarif Resmi Jasa Cutting Sriwijaya Grafika
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-1 leading-tight">Daftar Harga Jasa Laser Cutting Palembang 2026</h1>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 mt-6 leading-relaxed text-lg">
          Daftar tarif resmi jasa pemotongan presisi <strong>Laserindo Palembang</strong> (divisi spesialisasi dari <strong>Sriwijaya Grafika</strong>). Workshop kami di Talang Jambe dilengkapi 3 lini mesin industri: <strong>Laser Fiber</strong> (khusus plat logam), <strong>CNC Router</strong> (kayu, MDF, PVC, ACP), dan <strong>Laser CO2</strong> (akrilik presisi).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
      <!-- Info 3 Mesin -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-primary/40 transition-all flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-zinc-900">
            <img 
              src="/img/mesin-potong/mesin-potong-laser-fiber_poco.webp" 
              alt="Mesin Laser Fiber Plat Logam Sriwijaya Grafika Palembang" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
              loading="lazy" 
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm text-brand-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-white/10">
              01
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Mesin Laser Fiber</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Khusus Plat Logam (m²)</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
              Memotong plat besi, galvanis, stainless steel, dan aluminium hingga tebal 12 mm dengan toleransi 0.1 mm bebas gerinda.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-primary/40 transition-all flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-zinc-900">
            <img 
              src="/img/mesin-potong/mesin-potong-CNC-router_poco.webp" 
              alt="Mesin CNC Router Lembaran ACP dan Kayu Sriwijaya Grafika Palembang" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
              loading="lazy" 
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm text-brand-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-white/10">
              02
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Mesin CNC Router</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Lembaran / Keping Utuh</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
              Spindle putaran tinggi untuk memotong ACP fasad, plywood multiplek, MDF / MHR, dan PVC board lembaran besar (122 x 244 cm).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-primary/40 transition-all flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-zinc-900">
            <img 
              src="/img/mesin-potong/mesin-potong-laser-CO2_poco.webp" 
              alt="Mesin Laser CO2 Akrilik Presisi Sriwijaya Grafika Palembang" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
              loading="lazy" 
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm text-brand-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-white/10">
              03
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Mesin Laser CO2</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Khusus Akrilik (Menit)</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
              Tabung sinar laser CO2 untuk akrilik 2 – 10 mm. Tepi potongan halus dan mengkilap (flame-polished) tanpa butuh poles ulang.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel 1: Laser Fiber -->
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Harga Jasa Laser Cutting Plat Besi, Stainless & Aluminium Per Meter (Fiber Laser)</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Berlaku untuk plat lembaran logam, dihitung berdasarkan satuan luas per meter persegi (m²). *Desain standar.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-700">Satuan: Per m²</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-zinc-800">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-brand-surface-alt">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Material Plat</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Ketebalan</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Tarif Jasa Potong</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {pricingFiberLaser.map((item) => (
                <tr class="border-t border-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors">
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 font-medium text-white">{item.material}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-zinc-400">{item.thickness}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-right font-semibold text-brand-primary">{formatPrice(item.price)} <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-normal">/ {item.unit}</span></td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel 2: CNC Router -->
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Harga Jasa CNC Router Per Lembar (ACP, Multiplek, MDF, PVC)</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Berlaku untuk pemotongan lembaran kayu komposit dan panel arsitektur. Dihitung per keping. *Desain standar.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-700">Satuan: Per Keping</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-zinc-800">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-brand-surface-alt">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Material Lembaran</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Ketebalan</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Tarif Jasa Potong</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {pricingCncRouter.map((item) => (
                <tr class="border-t border-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors">
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 font-medium text-white">{item.material}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-zinc-400">{item.thickness}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-right font-semibold text-brand-primary">{formatPrice(item.price)} <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-normal">/ {item.unit}</span></td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel 3: Laser CO2 -->
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. Tarif Jasa Laser Cutting Akrilik Per Menit (Laser CO2)</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Khusus lembaran akrilik transparan, warna, dan susu. Hasil tepi mengkilap tanpa poles. *Desain standar.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-700">Satuan: Per Menit</span>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-zinc-800">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-brand-surface-alt">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Material</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Ketebalan</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Tarif Jasa Potong</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {pricingCo2Laser.map((item) => (
                <tr class="border-t border-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors">
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 font-medium text-white">{item.material}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-zinc-400">{item.thickness}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3.5 text-right font-semibold text-brand-primary">{formatPrice(item.price)} <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-normal">/ {item.unit}</span></td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel 4: Produk Fabrikasi Lengkap -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4. Estimasi Fabrikasi Unit Jadi (Produksi + Pasang)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Untuk klien yang membutuhkan paket lengkap terima beres meliputi rangka hollow, cat finishing, dan pemasangan di lokasi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-zinc-800">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-brand-surface-alt">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Produk/Layanan</th>
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Keterangan</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-300">Estimasi Biaya Jadi</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {pricingServices.map((p) => (
                <tr class="border-t border-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-800/30 transition-colors">
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 font-medium text-white">{p.item}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 text-zinc-400 text-xs">{p.note ?? '-'}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-4 text-right text-zinc-200 font-semibold">{formatPrice(p.lowest)} - {formatPrice(p.highest)} <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-normal">/ {p.unit}</span></td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Faktor Penentu Biaya -->
      <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-xl p-8 border border-zinc-800 mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ketentuan & Faktor Penentu Biaya Potong</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Ketentuan Desain & Bahan</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Tarif tercantum adalah untuk <strong>desain standar</strong> dengan file siap potong (format .DXF, .DWG, .CDR, atau .AI skala 1:1).</li>
              <li>Pelanggan dipersilakan membawa bahan lembaran sendiri ke workshop, atau menggunakan stok material yang kami sediakan.</li>
              <li>Tersedia bantuan konsultasi dan perapian file nesting untuk memaksimalkan efisiensi bahan.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Faktor Tambahan</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
              <li><strong>Kerapatan Motif:</strong> Motif dengan jalur potong sangat padat (misal ukiran songket halus) dapat memengaruhi durasi waktu mesin.</li>
              <li><strong>Gas Bantu Khusus:</strong> Pemotongan plat stainless atau aluminium dengan hasil putih bersih mengilap menggunakan gas nitrogen.</li>
              <li><strong>Diskon Volume:</strong> Penawaran harga khusus tersedia untuk pengerjaan proyek volume besar atau vendor rekanan rutin.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-xl p-8 border border-zinc-800">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Keunggulan Workshop Kami</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>✅ <strong>3 Lini Mesin Sendiri:</strong> Fiber Laser, CNC Router, dan CO2 Laser beroperasi langsung di Talang Jambe.</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Presisi Tinggi:</strong> Toleransi akurasi hingga 0.1 mm, potongan rapi tanpa gerinda (dross-free).</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Warisan Sejak 2008:</strong> Dipercaya lebih dari 16 tahun melalui Sriwijaya Grafika.</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Garansi Kualitas:</strong> Jaminan hasil potong sesuai gambar kerja dan garansi 1 tahun untuk paket jadi.</li>
            <li>✅ <strong>Transparan & Cepat:</strong> Estimasi biaya jelas di muka tanpa biaya tersembunyi.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-surface-alt rounded-xl p-8 border border-zinc-800">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Cara Pesan Jasa Potong</h3>
          <ol class="space-y-3 text-zinc-400 text-sm list-decimal pl-5">
            <li>Kirim file gambar/vektor (.DXF/.DWG/.CDR/.AI) atau sketsa ke WhatsApp <strong>{SITE.contact.phone}</strong>.</li>
            <li>Sebutkan jenis material, ketebalan, dan ukuran lembaran yang akan dipotong.</li>
            <li>Tim teknis kami menghitung kebutuhan waktu dan memberikan penawaran harga resmi.</li>
            <li>Setelah konfirmasi, proses pemotongan dikerjakan presisi oleh operator berpengalaman.</li>
            <li>Hasil potong dapat diambil langsung di workshop atau dikirim ke lokasi proyek Anda.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16">
        <CTABanner />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
